<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:30:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Drop as Stock Rise Saps Demand for Haven Bonds&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Rises as Rebound in Tech Stocks Helps Revive Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>“美元风暴”：美元有望实现 2024 年以来最长涨幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024</link><description>由于人工智能贸易的破裂和利率上升刺激了对避险资产的需求，美元有望实现两年来最长的月度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024'&gt;“美元风暴”：美元有望实现 2024 年以来最长涨幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：‘Dollar Storm:’ Greenback on Track for Longest Winning Run Since 2024&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:44:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Has Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Rally: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Saks 如何重塑奢侈品集团典范</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video</link><description>彭博社的 Romaine Bostick 报道了 Exemplar Luxury Group（前身为 Saks Global）自今年早些时候摆脱破产保护以来如何重塑自身，以在奢侈品领域重新开始。 Exemplar Luxury Group 首席执行官 Geoffroy van Raemdonck、FIT 副教授 Shawn Grain Carter、Telsey Advisory Group 首席执行官 Dana Telsey 以及 Exemplar Luxury Group 总裁兼首席文化官 Darcy Penick 分享了他们的想法。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video'&gt;Saks 如何重塑奢侈品集团典范&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Saks Is Reclaiming Luxury as Exemplar Luxury Group&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:18:01 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>